<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<GenAiPlugin xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
    <description>This topic allows an agent to apply a discount on a specific product in a quote and Update quantity of the product simultaneously. The agent provides the product name and discount percentage, and updates quantity and the system automatically updates the discounted value and the quanitiy of the product</description>
    <developerName>Apply_Discount_and_Update_quantity_of_the_product</developerName>
    <genAiFunctions>
        <functionName>Apply_Discount_and_Quantity_of_the_product</functionName>
    </genAiFunctions>
    <genAiPluginInstructions>
        <description>Always user should specify last two digits of the quote number, percentage value, update quantity and product name</description>
        <developerName>instruction_alwaysuser0</developerName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <masterLabel>instruction_alwaysuser0</masterLabel>
    </genAiPluginInstructions>
    <genAiPluginInstructions>
        <description>Always when the user provides all these details then you can update the discount percentage and updated quantity and display the sucessfull messge at the end of the conversation</description>
        <developerName>instruction_alwayswhen1</developerName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <masterLabel>instruction_alwayswhen1</masterLabel>
    </genAiPluginInstructions>
    <genAiPluginInstructions>
        <description>Apply discount  and update quantity to the product based on the users request</description>
        <developerName>instruction_applydisco2</developerName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <masterLabel>instruction_applydisco2</masterLabel>
    </genAiPluginInstructions>
    <language>en_US</language>
    <masterLabel>Apply Discount and Update quantity of the product</masterLabel>
    <pluginType>Topic</pluginType>
    <scope>The agent can request a discount  and update quantity on a specific product within a quote by providing the product name discount percentage and the quantity of the product. The system will retrieve the original unit price of the product from the associated price book, calculate the new discounted price and the quanititynof the product, and automatically update the unit price in the quote line item. This ensures accurate pricing adjustments without manual calculations, improving efficiency and accuracy in the quoting process.</scope>
</GenAiPlugin>
